                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJb3wiSkWuQjQRYj2ArhtpNoU/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUR3MU43ZHR3RRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "7 courses that you get to customize! When you start your entree, they bring in a vinegar slushie that helps you digest so you can eat more. My family and friends always start getting full by entree and the slushie helps a bit. The servers are so nice and patient and are always around so you can ask for refills or a change in the future courses. The fish was a bit dry and we know this because we got two tender and juicy fish but one was a bit over done, but once we mentioned how it was a bit dry they swapped our fish and gave us a new plate with everything minus the other piece of meat that was originally on it. I would definitely come back and try their other options in the meal course! They also held our luggage for us at the front but dont forget to pick it up!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
